1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,680
(Sheldon:)which can all be harmful
to an unborn baby.

2
00:00:02,683 --> 00:00:06,153
No HoneyBaked Ham
in a hot tub... got it.

3
00:00:06,153 --> 00:00:07,483
(Sheldon:)Oh, no bubble baths either.

4
00:00:07,488 --> 00:00:09,618
(Sheldon:)They can increase the risk
of a urinary tract infection.

5
00:00:09,623 --> 00:00:10,893
(Leonard:)Okay, have fun.

6
00:00:10,891 --> 00:00:13,791
(Sheldon:)Oh, and no swordfish, king
mackerel, shark or tilefish,

7
00:00:13,794 --> 00:00:15,324
(Sheldon:)which are all high in mercury.

8
00:00:15,329 --> 00:00:16,459
(Leonard:)We're leaving now!

9
00:00:16,463 --> 00:00:17,663
(Sheldon:)Oh, and no contact with
guinea pigs

10
00:00:17,665 --> 00:00:18,965
(Sheldon:)or hamsters or their droppings,

11
00:00:18,966 --> 00:00:22,266
(Sheldon:)uh, no-no cat litter boxes,
no paint fumes...

12
00:00:22,269 --> 00:00:24,769
(Penny:)Okay, we're leaving,
love you, bye!

13
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:28,640
(Sheldon:)Boy, do I love restrictions.

14
00:00:29,843 --> 00:00:32,273
(Penny:)Hey.

15
00:00:32,279 --> 00:00:33,309
(Howard:)Where is everybody?

16
00:00:33,313 --> 00:00:34,943
(Amy:)Oh, we're the first ones here.

17
00:00:34,948 --> 00:00:36,718
(Penny:)Oh.

18
00:00:36,717 --> 00:00:38,817
(Howard:)Cool.

19
00:00:38,819 --> 00:00:40,589
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

20
00:00:40,587 --> 00:00:42,017
(Howard:)Cool.

21
00:00:42,022 --> 00:00:44,222
(mellow jazz music playing)

22
00:00:48,362 --> 00:00:49,832
(Howard:)You know, I don't
remember the last time

23
00:00:49,830 --> 00:00:51,600
(Howard:)it was just you and me
hanging out.

24
00:00:51,598 --> 00:00:54,568
(Amy:)Oh, I do.
It was three years ago.

25
00:00:54,568 --> 00:00:58,018
(Howard:)Oh, yeah, and we said
we should do it more often.

